### Project data — caches and generated artifacts, not source ###
# Everything under data/ is re-derivable from EDGAR and Finnhub, and grows
# fast: stored filings alone reached 59MB after two companies. An earlier
# version ignored only data/cache/, which would have committed every stored
# filing in data/documents/.
.cache/
data/
build/
.coverage
*.log

### OS / editor / local tooling ###
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
# Design-tool sidecar. DESIGN.md is the artifact worth keeping; this is the
# machine-readable copy the tool regenerates from it.
.impeccable/
